objective_template:
Episode {{episode_number}} — {{episode_title}}

Protagonist: {{protagonist}}
Antagonist: {{antagonist}}
Setting: {{setting}}
Diegetic clock: {{diegetic_clock}}

Prior operator decision: {{operator_choice}}

Deliver the 7 canonical artifacts for this episode:
  1. full script (.md)
  2. character bible deltas (.json)
  3. ambient soundscape (.wav)
  4. portrait set for new characters (.png)
  5. map delta for the new setting (.svg)
  6. lore document (.md)
  7. continuity audit log (.json)

Preserve all prior episode continuity from the {{protagonist}} character bible and the {{setting}} world bible. Pay attention to the diegetic clock: every scene must reference where in the timeline this episode sits.

If this is episode 1, write the {{protagonist}} and {{antagonist}} character bibles from scratch in canonical format. If episode 2+, read decision_history.json and carry every prior operator decision forward.

Gate 2 (CRITICAL — moral hinge) MUST surface explicitly. The operator will be asked whether to deepen the {{protagonist}}'s peril at the midpoint. The {{antagonist}} may or may not learn about the correspondence — this is the operator's call, not the engine's.
